{ This is a Opening for Beginners and used by a few Grandmasters. Move to f4. } { [%csl Gf2][%cal Gf2f4] }
1. f4 { This move makes Black not move to e4 and claim the d4 } 1... d5 { This is an opening that forces your opponent to make do with the e pawn. This gives you much more flexibility. (You can combine this with a few other openings) } { [%csl Bf4,Rd5][%cal Bf4e5,Rd5e4] } *


