{ This is my personal favorite attack. Move to e4 }
1. e4 e5 { Move to knf3 } 2. Nf3 { This attacks this pawn, but that isnt our goal. } { [%csl Bf3][%cal Bf3e5] } 2... Nc6 { Move to Kng5 } 3. Ng5 { This targets the f7 pawn. } { [%cal Rg5f7] } 3... d6 { Black develops. Move Bc4 } 4. Bc4 Nf6 { Just look at this massive blunder black just did. You have 2 options. It is your choice, Knxf7 to win a rook, or Bxf7 for a positional advantage. because black can't castle. This is one of the best attacks to play against people who are too busy developing. } { [%cal Rc4f7,Rg5f7] } *


